sequenceDiagram
    participant Human as Human/project decision
    participant Task as Task card / alignment
    participant Lane as Lane handoff input
    participant Script as naos_parallel_lane_handoff.py
    participant CPR as control-plane-review
    participant Review as Human review

    Human->>Task: Record parallel_lane_opportunity
    Human->>Task: Choose parallel_lane_decision
    alt Decision is sequential or deferred
        Task->>Review: Keep as planning/scope evidence only
    else Decision is declared
        Task->>Lane: Fill naos/lane_handoffs/<lane>.yaml
        Lane->>Script: Generate local handoff report
        Script->>CPR: Read declared handoff evidence
        CPR->>Review: Emit HITL reason codes and evidence refs
    end
    Review->>Review: Disposition, waive, remediate, or continue
